// swamp1's soundtrack on zoo, which has no soundtrack and no ambient sound, so a
// loopback recording holds the music alone (sound-record.ps1 -Probe probe-music -Music 0.6):
// its level against the tone probes' shows how the music sits against the world.
probe:
waitforplayer
wait 2
stuffcmd "loadsoundtrack music/swamp1.mus"
wait 1
stuffcmd "playsong normal"
wait 40
stuffcmd "pendingevents"
end
